/* Agents on the map: Latin American Spanish captions, over the English film. Each English narration line (the key, exactly as in src/narration.js) maps to its caption.
   Only the captions change: the picture, the voice and the timings stay English, so the site plays the same film, and the video, which has no captions on its picture, takes es.srt.
   The Spanish page loads this before the film; tools/captions.py (with FILM_LANG=es) writes captions/es.srt and es.vtt from it, and fails if a line has no caption.
   Words: Babilonia, Nabopolasar, Nabucodonosor, Marduk, Etemenanki, la torre-templo, a. C.; la empresa for the utility, un rol, un agente, la plataforma de IA,
   el agente de cortes and el agente del mapa, permisos for rights, un responsable for an owner, quien dirige comercialización for the head of retail,
   un gestor de facturación for a billing officer (never "agente", which is the software), facturación for billing, un hogar en dificultades for hardship,
   un recargo por atraso for a late fee, el acceso for a sign-in, una derivación for a hand-off, informar, redactar, verificar y ejecutar for the four levels,
   un ayudante for a helper, el relato de la Torre de Babel, el libro del Génesis. Numbers stay as the film shows them: 620 and 605 a. C., 212 planes. */
